4|0@totalwar^1439958312#cu7x520:SwissCakeRolls$:Will there be a ranking system for teams, or some depth to group organizing and stat keeping? I was thinking of ways games could easily be organized, so as not to need to chat strategy with your new team each game. Maybe instead of a minute spawn selection there could be a 30 second strategy vote, to where there's something like 4 or more options to vote on strategies. That is to say, which direction a bulk of the force will attack in, for instance. Obviously there will always be people sending a unit, or their entire group in another direction, but maybe this would remove the need to chat strategy at the beginning of every match, and instead now, everyone can do a quick vote, and know what the general plan is. This could also be skip-able for organized groups. Then followed by a 30 second spawn selection. 
