6|0@totalwar^1439812662#cu5s7n8:BttLsht$:Are eastern factions planned e.g. Persia, Parthia, Armenia? Is 3 units per player here to stay or do you have any plans for game modes with less players but more units? Carthage when!
6|0@totalwar^1439997027#cu8b63b:DogbertCA$:Are eastern factions planned e.g. Persia, Parthia, Armenia? Not in the near future, but there’s nothing preventing us from adding such factions. We’d love to get at least one Middle Eastern faction into the game at some point. Is 3 units per player here to stay or do you have any plans for game modes with less players but more units? We feel that 3 units per player is just right for Total War: ARENA. We tried many different options, and they all somehow felt wrong. With 3 units we have the balance we want to achieve between ARENA being a game of strategy &amp; positioning as well as a game of skill &amp; micro movement. You can micro more than in any other TW game, but you still have the strategic element of flanking, surrounding, and manoeuvring with three units. Carthage when! We’d love to do Carthage at some point, but it’s not in our plans for the near future. 
