2|0@totalwar^1440000662#cu8dkyq:DogbertCA$:We have indeed considered Spartacus! He’d be a commander of a mercenary faction, which consists of multiple commanders, each of which has a unique unit tree (most likely a shortened one). Spartacus would have a mix of deserted Roman soldiers, slaves, and bandits. We’re not sure when we might get around to doing something like this, but it’s something we’ve planned for, and the game code is already designed to handle such situations.
