4|0@totalwar^1439822269#cu5wbgq:unseine$:Is fixing pikes a priority? Their interactions are backwards right now.
3|0@totalwar^1439996700#cu8aytg:DogbertCA$:Pikes are a difficult unit to play, but they can be very rewarding. They are defensive, to be used at choke points. In an uncoordinated team, they can quickly become worthless if the teammates aren’t using them correctly in their strategy. In a well-coordinated team, however, Pikes can become a key part of strategy. We don’t think they’re broken, but we are working on improving how they behave (just like we’re improving other units).
2|0@totalwar^1440000449#cu8dfsv:unseine$:I dont think they are weak at all they just dont interact properly very often. The design and strength is very well done they just sometimes decide to raise them for no reason or let units run inside them. Yesterday I charged cavalry into the back side of a pike unit and died once they broke through. Thanks for answering and I appreciate that unit interaction is still being worked on. The game is amazing.
