3|0@totalwar^1439830792#cu61f10:memccann-$:and chariots
7|0@totalwar^1439997851#cu8box6:DogbertCA$:We’re not planning on adding them soon, but we do have plans to include them in the future. Both elephants and chariots are incredibly cool units, but they’re also very difficult to balance in a competitive multiplayer game that focuses on realism. Before we introduce them, we want to make sure that they fit with the game, that they are fun to play, and above all that they’re not OP. To do that, we need to do a major change to how both elephants and chariots work in battle compared to Rome II, which is why we’ll take some time to get there.
